  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, double-sided mounting. An alternative to \"SW_MX_HotSwap_THT_double\". Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 2.75u_PCBStab (courtyard 52.34x19.00mm). Cherry MX PCB-mount stabilizer holes included.")
